    "head_matter": "In the Matter of DISCIPLINE OF LeslieAnn HAACKE.\nNo. D-2745.\nSupreme Court of the United States\nNov. 12, 2013.\nLeslieAnn Haacke, of Scottsdale, Arizona, is suspended from the practice of law in this Court and a rule will issue, returnable within 40 days, requiring her to show cause why she should not disbarred from the practice of law in this Court."
